# REPORT GENERATION RULES

> **TL;DR:** This guide defines how to automatically generate comprehensive weekly reports from Memory Bank data, including tasks, lessons, and progress tracking.

## 🎯 Purpose

Generate structured reports that:
- Summarize completed work for a time period
- Extract lessons learned and insights
- Track progress and ongoing work
- Provide data for planning and improvement
- Serve as project documentation

